window.MC_CONTENT_EXTRA.push({"a":"ziggs","b":"masteryi","win":["Ziggs","Ziggs","Ziggs","Ziggs","Skill","Skill","Master Yi"],"spikes":[{"when":"Lvl 1-3","text":"Artillery heaven: Q poke taxes every last-hit, W knockback interrupts his approach, and E mines make Alpha Strike angles suicidal - he simply cannot reach you."},{"when":"Lvl 6","text":"Mega Inferno Bomb adds a map-wide nuke he cannot dodge on a farming pattern - punish his every recall and convert your poke lead into towers."},{"when":"1st item","text":"Even with items he must cross Q, the mine slow and W to touch you - keep the full obstacle course between you and his spike stays irrelevant."},{"when":"Late","text":"Highlander finally threatens you - it makes him immune to your mine slows, so buy peel, hug your frontline, and Satchel the instant he commits rather than trusting E to hold him."}],"wants":{"you":["Every wave bombed before he can touch it","Mines slowing his walk-up before Highlander","Tower gold banked from your zoning lead"],"foe":["Sneaking farm under tower through poke","Meditate stalling to his late-game spike","A Highlander flank that dodges your peel"]},"early":"Levels 1-3 are target practice: Q Bouncing Bomb out-ranges everything he does, W Satchel Charge knocks him off any approach, and E Hexplosive Minefield turns Alpha Strike angles into traps - he loses CS, health, and patience simultaneously while you shove waves into his tower for free.","mid":"Levels 4-5 nothing changes - he still has no gap-close that survives your zoning - and 6 stretches your lead: Mega Inferno Bomb punishes his recalls and converts poke into plates and towers. When he Meditates to heal, Satchel him: the knock-away interrupts the channel and he loses the entire heal.","late":"Only deep into items does his Highlander flank even the contest - it makes him slow-immune, so your minefield stops peeling, and Meditate on 10s heals back the chip you land. Group permanently, buy Grievous Wounds, sit behind your frontline, hold Satchel purely for his commit, and close the game you already won.","whys":["You out-range and poke him with Q artillery from level 1.","At 2 Q zoning and W knockback keep him off the wave.","Level 3 E minefield and poke deny any approach.","Levels 4-5 he still cannot gap-close your artillery zoning.","At 6 Alpha Strike's untargetable dash dodges your bomb outright.","First item Wuju Style's true damage ignores every stat you buy.","Late Highlander makes him immune to your mine slows entirely."]});
